# @jack-henry/* is published to public npm (Apache-2.0).
#
# A developer machine inside Jack Henry routes the whole scope to an internal
# Artifactory mirror via ~/.npmrc; public CI has no route to that host and no
# credentials for it. Without this pin the same package name resolves from two
# different registries depending on who runs the install, and the committed
# lockfile records whichever one went first — which surfaces as a red build on
# a release rather than during development.
#
# Verified identical at the versions this depends on: jh-ui 1.15.5,
# jh-core 1.6.1, jh-icons 2.0.0.
@jack-henry:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
